    <Positioned left="84" top="762" width="283.6">
      <Text fontSize="20" color="#16222C" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">解释（推断，非文档原文）</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="84" top="792" width="1184.04">
      <Text fontSize="17" color="#4A5964" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">色标处误差为 0，说明角度→位置的映射正确；色标之间系统性偏亮，与在线性光空间插值后转回 sRGB 的行为一致。这是推断，不是文</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="84" top="827.62" width="87.52">
      <Text fontSize="17" color="#4A5964" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">档原文。</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="60" top="940" width="185.56">
      <Text fontSize="22" color="#16222C" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">三条可操作结论</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="60" top="980">
      <Container width="8" height="44" color="#B4432B" borderRadius="4"/>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="84" top="982" width="291.58">
      <Text fontSize="19" color="#16222C" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">只在色标位置对颜色做硬承诺</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="84" top="1008" width="445.662">
      <Text fontSize="17" color="#4A5964" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">色标处 Δ=0；中间色一律回读或改用不透明分段。</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="60" top="1042">
      <Container width="8" height="44" color="#B4432B" borderRadius="4"/>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="84" top="1044" width="248.26">
      <Text fontSize="19" color="#16222C" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">要精确的中间色就加色标</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="84" top="1070" width="457.678">
      <Text fontSize="17" color="#4A5964" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">把期望的中间色本身写成 stop，比依赖插值可靠。</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="60" top="1104">
      <Container width="8" height="44" color="#B4432B" borderRadius="4"/>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="84" top="1106" width="226.6">
      <Text fontSize="19" color="#16222C" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">颜色断言用绝对差之和</Text>
    </Positioned>
    <Positioned left="84" top="1132" width="716.595">
      <Text fontSize="17" color="#4A5964" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">Δ = Σ|R−R′|+|G−G′|+|B−B′|，阈值按用途定；本页样本的 Δ 范围 0–69。</Text>
    </Positioned>
